================================================================================================================
ENVELOPE DESCRIPTION -- target source 30m
================================================================================================================
  60,000 episodes, 5 features: vol_48, vratio, vol_slope, sandwich, off_mark
  target: running MAE and MFE, sign-folded, UNCLAMPED (see docstring)
  quantiles (0.05, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 0.95)   horizons ['0.5h', '1h', '2h', '5h', '10h']

======================================================================================================================
CONFORMALIZED QUANTILE REGRESSION -- QTREE only, calibrated on val
======================================================================================================================
  WHY QTREE AND NOTHING ELSE. One base model, not four. QTREE carries
  the strongest point-estimate skill on MFE, so it is the one worth
  asking whether that skill can be paired with a formal coverage
  guarantee instead of the quantile loss's unguaranteed calibration.

  THE GUARANTEE ASSUMES EXCHANGEABILITY AND THIS DATA IS NOT
  EXCHANGEABLE. The halves analysis measured a 1.06pp gap next to the
  cut and 3.05pp further out, worse in 80 of 80 cells. So the
  hypothesis, stated before the numbers: the val-fitted correction
  holds on HO1, which abuts val in time, and decays on HO2. A failure
  on HO2 confirms the drift mechanism through a more rigorous tool --
  it is not a defect of CQR.

  SECOND LEAK, SMALLER AND EASY TO MISS. Val chose QTREE's iteration
  count. That is not a new discipline exception -- val has always been
  the iteration block and is still never scored -- but the model was
  stopped where pinball was lowest ON THESE ROWS, so the calibration
  residuals are optimistic and the conformal width is biased DOWNWARD.
  Every correction below is therefore a slight under-correction, and a
  failure reads as 'at least this bad', never as 'at most'.

  WHAT CQR GUARANTEES IS THE PAIR, NOT THE LEVEL: the (q5,q95)
  interval at 90% and (q25,q75) at 50%. The 5-level gap is reported
  next to it because the rest of this project tracks it, but it is not
  what the method promises.

